{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x271efa",
      "back_en": "Oshtor on one side.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exato."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x271f7d",
      "back_en": "bearers of the Akuruka, like Oshtor...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27200d",
      "back_en": "And over there is Mikazuchi's brother, Raiko...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27224a",
      "back_en": "You were summoned here by direct order of my",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272279",
      "back_en": "lord. You have your place here without question, Haku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'sem questão' soa literal mas ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2722d8",
      "back_en": "He kept talking about making me 'succeed' him",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Sentido mantido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27232a",
      "back_en": "I hope he's not planning to reveal our",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272357",
      "back_en": "relationship to all these people...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272384",
      "back_en": "Who is that man?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2723bd",
      "back_en": "What is a man like that doing in our midst...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27253a",
      "back_en": "Our liege now enters!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27257e",
      "back_en": "a man in an extravagant wheelchair.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2725a4",
      "back_en": "The Mikado--my brother.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2725fa",
      "back_en": "You may all lift your heads.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272668",
      "back_en": "The Mikado lazily casts his eyes across the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272723",
      "back_en": "We need no praise. We hone our skills for",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'no such' simplificado, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272754",
      "back_en": "your service, my liege. We conquer all who oppose",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'use'->'serviço' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272790",
      "back_en": "Good. The recent past has given me much cause",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2728f0",
      "back_en": "We shall begin our invasion of Tuskur.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272992",
      "back_en": "...Invade Tuskur?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272a33",
      "back_en": "So this invasion is... completely unprovoked?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272a61",
      "back_en": "Dude, why are you doing this...? And what",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Bro' (=irmão, o Mikado) virou 'Cara', perde a relação; inconsistente com 'Irmão' em 0x275a6f."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272aad",
      "back_en": "My liege.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272ab7",
      "back_en": "I would hear your opinion on this matter.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272b4d",
      "back_en": "They can't understand why Oshtor was chosen,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272bbc",
      "back_en": "It pains me to say... that I must disagree with",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272dd6",
      "back_en": "I ask that you reconsider your decision,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'please' omitido, sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272e53",
      "back_en": "Oshtor's argument is reasonable, but those present",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27304d",
      "back_en": "And you? What do you think... Haku?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2730ad",
      "back_en": "seconds, I just stand there, shocked.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'dumbfounded'->'chocado' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27313b",
      "back_en": "I feel all eyes turn to me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2731f5",
      "back_en": "Believe me, I'm with you on this one.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27327d",
      "back_en": "opinion.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27331b",
      "back_en": "even enmity.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273388",
      "back_en": "person?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'man'->'pessoa', diferença mínima."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2733fd",
      "back_en": "in this case.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273408",
      "back_en": "I... agree with what Oshtor has to say.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273471",
      "back_en": "Gah, this guy's scaring me a lot...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Palavrão suavizado, sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2734c9",
      "back_en": "honestly, since he asked for my opinion...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27351a",
      "back_en": "A worm like you doesn't deserve to even exist in a",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'unfit'->'não merece' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273678",
      "back_en": "It was I who gave permission. Stand down, Vurai.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'him' omitido mas implícito."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273730",
      "back_en": "knife...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273ac2",
      "back_en": "My liege. Allow me to execute this task.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273d9f",
      "back_en": "What is your decision, my liege?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273dc8",
      "back_en": "Woshis, please present your assessment.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273dff",
      "back_en": "My humble opinion is that...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274021",
      "back_en": "Lady Munechika for this task.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2740b9",
      "back_en": "our numbers will necessarily be limited.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274111",
      "back_en": "terrain. Lord Raiko would be perfectly suited.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274140",
      "back_en": "And Lord Dekopompo shall serve as our offense.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274492",
      "back_en": "one bestowed with the title of Guardia.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Guardian' deveria ser 'Guardião'; 'Guardia' não é PT padrão."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2744bb",
      "back_en": "Lord Woshis.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2747b3",
      "back_en": "You have some objection?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2747cc",
      "back_en": "My name was not mentioned.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274961",
      "back_en": "What of it?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2749b6",
      "back_en": "...What are you trying to say?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274bf5",
      "back_en": "pleasure in the thrill of battle.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274c53",
      "back_en": "a disadvantage.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'liability'->'desvantagem' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274cba",
      "back_en": "You DARE!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274d42",
      "back_en": "Such words are wasted on someone like me...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274dce",
      "back_en": "again.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275182",
      "back_en": "Woshis, huh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275899",
      "back_en": "Geez. Oshtor's a monster too.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2759db",
      "back_en": "animosity with Oshtor.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'toward'->'com' levemente solto, ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2759f4",
      "back_en": "Guess the existence of my br-- the Mikado is",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Corte br/ir bem preservado."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275afc",
      "back_en": "I do not understand...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275b13",
      "back_en": "Does something trouble you, Lord Raiko...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275ba9",
      "back_en": "What are your thoughts on this, Shichirya?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275e20",
      "back_en": "Lord Raiko!? Such talk is--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Tal fala' literal mas ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275e6e",
      "back_en": "dawning on this land, I will not sit idly by...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275eae",
      "back_en": "The time may soon come when I ask you to act",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275edd",
      "back_en": "where I cannot. Matters may shortly become...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272530",
      "back_en": "He comes.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27269c",
      "back_en": "Your valor in the previous war was commendable.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272e86",
      "back_en": "in the hall don't seem to have taken it that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x272eb5",
      "back_en": "way.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2732b8",
      "back_en": "me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2735e6",
      "back_en": "to be present here as Oshtor's subordinate.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273800",
      "back_en": "Truly, the kamunagi of Tuskur were persons of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273a2f",
      "back_en": "Nya-HA! If that is the case, then please let--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x273fe5",
      "back_en": "counsel.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274357",
      "back_en": "You may leave it in my hands!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274526",
      "back_en": "arise.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274ad1",
      "back_en": "Ridiculous. You wanted me to have mercy on",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Laughable'->'Ridículo' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274f99",
      "back_en": "Woshis continues to instruct the government and",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x274fcb",
      "back_en": "military officials lining the hall.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'corredor' por 'hall', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27501d",
      "back_en": "these difficult individuals just like",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'temperamental'->'difíceis' aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275177",
      "back_en": "political.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2751ed",
      "back_en": "To have a man of such questionable background as",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27532d",
      "back_en": "I thank you for your words of caution.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2755ca",
      "back_en": "as though he's trying to intimidate me.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275622",
      "back_en": "...You're right.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Source é 'alone.'; alvo '...Tem razão.' diverge totalmente do sentido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x27588e",
      "back_en": "before...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275998",
      "back_en": "As an ally... huh?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275a6f",
      "back_en": "spotlight like that again... Take it easy, Brother,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Come on'->'Vai com calma' nuance leve, aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x275b6e",
      "back_en": "rushed. Why would our sovereign act with such",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'rush to such' reformulado, sentido ok."
    }
  ],
  "reviewed": 96
}